        </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="tr-foot">{{ t('Grades update every render as calls mature. Survivorship: no dead-name store — losses on delisted names are not captured (an honest bound).', '分数随结论成熟每次渲染更新。幸存者偏差：无退市名库 —— 退市名称亏损未被捕捉（诚实边界）。') }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
